WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:49.980
Someone once said...

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.790
There are red king crabs like 
big, juicy hamburgers...

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:01.200
Red Hamburking Crabs!

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:10.000
There are watermelons filled 
with sweet potatoes,

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.410
making a fruit that lets you enjoy the 
two seasons of summer and fall at once...

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:19.180
Sweetmelon Potatoes!

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.880
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:27.990
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:34.460
Reunion! Take-chan of Fairytale Castle!

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.610
Whoo-hoo! You're pretty darn fast!

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:51.140
At this rate, we'll probably arrive today!

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:54.350
I'll be there soon, Old Man!

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:16.890
Nice liver.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:37.980
Well, well... The Executive 
Chef's assistant...

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.850
Executive Chef's assistant?!

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:42.750
The Gourmet World's elite...?!

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:54.260
Have the cooks been gathered, Jojo?

00:04:55.230 --> 00:05:01.700
Only a third of what we need, but 
the collecting is proceeding apace.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:06.170
1,000 cooks to take to the 
Gourmet World as slaves...

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.510
Preparations have already 
been made over there.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:16.520
The Executive Chef is tired 
of waiting, so hurry.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:17.920
Yessir!

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.320
Anyway, Jojo...

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:25.290
That island of garbage is on its 
way to becoming a continent.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.300
I suppose they don't call 
this the Devil's Kitchen

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:32.330
and the Dining Table of Devils for nothing,

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.600
but still, that's an unusually 
large amount, isn't it?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:41.610
We need to raise the level of Gourmet 
Cells of everyone in the Gourmet Corp.,

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.480
so we're making ten times 
more food than usual,

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:48.150
in order to send as many of them 
as possible to the Gourmet World.

00:05:56.220 --> 00:06:00.060
Well, this is a surprise, Nijsseni-sama.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.290
Long time no see.

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:03.900
Tommyrod...

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.530
You've made a complete recovery.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.600
In fact, your cells have been revitalized.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:13.110
I suppose.

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:17.340
The bugs dwelling in my body are 
stronger than the ones I had before.

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:22.150
Next time, I'll crush Toriko to a pulp!

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.980
Never mind Toriko.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:28.790
Our goal is the Gourmet World now.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:32.160
If anything, our enemies are 
the Gourmet World elite...

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:37.500
The bastards of IGO's Biotope 0.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:41.430
If we can take a decent amount 
of skilled cooks there,

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:45.040
we'll have no more use for the Human World.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:50.170
After that, we can crush Toriko and the 
Human World together in one stroke.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.040
Right?

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:57.650
And how much longer do you 
intend to dawdle here, Star?

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:03.390
Capturing skilled chefs is no simple task.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:06.520
Starjun-sama is right.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:11.800
Many of IGO's top 100-ranked 
chefs are very clever

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:16.500
as well as being excellent at cooking.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.500
The top of the list would be National 
Gourmet Treasure, Setsuno...

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:24.610
...the Cooking King, Xuse... Serving Tray 
King, Yuda... Ramen Master Kurakage...

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:31.310
Oil Slick Wabutora... Iron Griddle Magician 
Moe... and Ethnic King, Claraman.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:36.090
And from a country that isn't 
a member-nation of the IGO,

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.220
the boss of the underground 
cooking world, Livebearer.

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:46.560
The top 30 chefs in particular 
will be difficult to capture.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:53.140
We intend to get all of them and 
make them into slaves, of course.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.070
Every last one of them...

00:07:56.510 --> 00:08:00.210
When the boss eventually has control 
of all the world's ingredients,

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:02.950
he'll need people to cook them.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:09.020
The cooking techniques that the 
chefs cultivated in the Human World

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.620
will be at our disposal in the Gourmet World.

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:16.760
If there are any chefs that give you a 
hard time when you try to abduct them,

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:21.000
you have permission to use the Nitro.

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:26.800
Nitro! N-No, that won't be necessary...

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:32.070
Right now, we're mass-producing GT 
Robots, including extra-large ones.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.610
These models are cutting edge, with 
much improved performance levels.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.280
Naturally, they're more durable, 
but they've also been loaded

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.980
with new functions such as "mimicry",

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.750
so I don't believe we'll need the Nitro...

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.290
I don't mind the employment of 
GT Robots as a use of force,

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:50.590
but there are evolved Nitro

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:55.060
that can control pheromones, 
which have a hypnotic effect.

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.300
They can be used.

00:08:56.830 --> 00:09:02.000
Yes, well, there are many clever people 
for whom pheromones don't work.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.300
They're convenient when it comes 
to the small fry, though...

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.570
I'll leave the means to you.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.580
I don't care how you do it, 
as long as you capture them.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.310
Anyway, target the higher-ranking cooks.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.550
Attack restaurants that 
have seven stars or higher.

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:16.350
Yessir!

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.020
What a waste...

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.860
There are fine chefs who don't 
work at a seven-star restaurant

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:25.890
and aren't in the top 100 ranking.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.230
Mammoth Beef Sauté, coming up!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.970
Chef! Dessert too, please!

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:42.040
Got it!

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.710
It's glittering!

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:47.850
Yep.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:53.220
I tried boiling down the Supear and 
Diamond Fig Crystal with Longevity Sugar.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.820
It'll work as either a jam or compote.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.460
Like this...

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:01.130
There! My special Brilliantart is done!

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:14.770
What is this sweetness that makes 
me want to get up and dance?!

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:17.240
I just hate the idea that 
it's going to be gone!

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:18.780
I want to taste more of it!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.050
Goodnight.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:29.420
Good work!

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.790
Chef Komatsu, this month's issue is out!

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:33.890
Monthly Gourmet!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:38.300
There it is! This month's world 
chef ranking! The best 100!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:43.670
The Cooking King, Xuse ranked 
first again this month...

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:47.270
The top-ranked chefs aren't going anywhere...

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.970
They're all incredible!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:56.080
99th place... Otake...

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:01.280
Otake... Could it be...?

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:24.640
Fairytale Castle

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:24.640
I knew it!

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:27.940
"Otake" meant you, Take-chan!

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:31.280
Well, look who showed up 
out of the blue! Koma-chan!

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:33.050
It's been too long!

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:35.920
Sorry to bother you when you're busy.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.450
No, I just closed up for the night.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:40.020
Come on.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:46.260
Anyway, Take-chan, 99th on the 
chef ranking... That's fantastic!

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.200
Oh, it's nothing.

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:51.830
Or nothing more than a stepping stone for me.

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:57.400
You've got a beautiful restaurant!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:01.340
To think, you're the same age as 
me and own a restaurant like this!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:03.480
You sure have hit the big time!

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:06.810
As someone who trained 
together with you, I'm proud!

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:11.050
This is so impressive!

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:17.490
Why, Koma-chan, you're the chef 
at Hotel Gourmet, as I recall.

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:18.930
Now that's impressive!

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:23.000
Yeah, but it's not like I run the place...

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.670
I saw your Century Soup on the news.

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:26.770
Really?!

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:30.570
Why haven't you applied for a patent? 
You could be raking in the money!

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:34.140
O-Oh, I don't really care about that stuff...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:35.780
If you got a lot of money,

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:39.580
you could hire a famous Gourmet Hunter 
to fetch you the best ingredients, right?

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:43.250
Then you could put new dishes on the 
menu and your restaurant would prosper.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:46.990
IGO's estimation of the restaurant would rise

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.620
and maybe it would even get more stars.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.420
I-I'm not sure about that...

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.190
I am!

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:58.600
Your reputation as a chef 
would improve too, Koma-chan.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.570
I bet you'd crack the top 
100 ranking in no time.

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:04.440
Oh, that's right. You don't 
need to save up money

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:07.470
to hire a Gourmet Hunter, do you, Koma-chan?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:11.140
You're partners with Toriko, aren't you?

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:16.910
Well, that's not why I became his partner.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.280
I just wanted to make delicious food

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:21.720
out of the ingredients 
that Toriko-san catches...

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.750
Boy, are you ever naive, Koma-chan.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:30.360
A pro chef always has to be making 
food that brings in the money.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:32.430
Brings in the money...

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:34.300
It doesn't matter how delicious the food is.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.900
If it's not earning you 
money, it's meaningless.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:41.370
You can't get to the top without money, see.

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.980
My goal is to stand at 
the top of the ranking.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:55.990
I'll do anything to get there.

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:58.020
Y-You've kind of...

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.520
...changed, Take-chan.

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:06.330
Compared to when you, me, and 
Ume-chan trained together,

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.870
you're... more ambitious, or...

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.470
Let's all become first-rate chefs

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.800
and make delicious food 
that everybody will love!

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:16.910
Ume-chan?

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:22.310
Yes, Ume-chan! Remember, the 
three of us were always together!

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:25.180
They used to call us "The Three Amigos".

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:27.550
Oh. I remember that guy now.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.390
I'd forgotten all about him.

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:33.090
I never look back on the past.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:41.100
Koma-chan, you say I've changed, but 
you've stayed the same <i>too much</i>.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:45.770
Sir, a reporter is here to see you.

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:47.400
Fine. I'll be right there.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:52.070
Sorry. I've got a magazine interview.

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:55.240
Once you're ranked, things get really busy.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.280
Sure...

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:03.380
Oh, that's right. Koma-chan, since 
you're here, have some of my food.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:05.190
Who knows, it may inspire you.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.600
Oh! There it is!

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:34.780
I see him! Toriko-sama!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.780
Toriko-sama is here!

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:37.980
He's coming in fast!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.820
Open the gate!

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.390
There'll be hell to pay if he 
breaks through another one.

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.020
You don't have to bother!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:54.370
They jumped!

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:09.880
Yeah!

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:15.620
No beasts within a five kilometer radius!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.120
Opening the gate!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.920
N-No. Never mind...

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:25.700
Th-They made it over a 
300-meter-high wall in one leap!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.030
What incredible leg strength!

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:29.230
A Battle Wolf...

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:34.370
Maybe they should redesign the wall...

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:35.740
What are you talkin' about?!

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:39.480
There are no Beasts in Biotope 
8 that can get over this wall.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:43.280
Except for that...

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.930
The Rainbow Fruit is ripe again!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:56.890
Think I'll grab a few on the way out!

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:00.860
Alright, Terry! Stop here!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:03.970
Good job.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.710
Did I keep you waiting, Toriko?

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.990
Hey, Coco. We just got here ourselves.

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:24.520
Is Sunny coming?

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:27.820
Nah, he turned it down.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:31.160
I see. And I guess Zebra 
goes without saying...

00:17:31.390 --> 00:17:32.800
Yeah, well...

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:37.130
Too bad, I wanted the four of us to tackle 
it together, like in the old days.

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:40.740
Can't be helped. We don't even 
know if it's really there.

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:44.670
Old Man Ichiryu's Full Course...

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:49.010
And the appetizer is in there...

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:54.520
It hasn't changed at all.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.820
Brings back memories, doesn't it?

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:57.790
Yeah.

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:06.190
Listen, boys, in the 
garden of Biotope 8 here,

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:09.630
there's just one amazing hidden treasure.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.270
What do you think it is?

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:12.200
I dunno.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:12.970
No idea.

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:13.800
Who knows?

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.800
Think about it! Just a little!

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:19.510
What's a treasure in the Gourmet Age?

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:22.410
Don't be stumped!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.010
It's an ingredient, right?! An ingredient!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:30.580
Actually, the appetizer for 
my precious Full Course

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:33.950
is hidden somewhere in this garden!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:39.060
One in each of the eight Biotopes... 
In other words, a total of eight!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:43.960
If you find all of them, you'll 
have my entire Full Course.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.530
Try and find 'em!

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:54.810
However, you'll never be able to 
get them without certain skills.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.440
One day, you may be able to find them...

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.950
Listen to me!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.220
Let's find 'em!

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:22.330
Alright. We haven't seen 
this in a long time, huh?

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:23.940
Nope.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.970
The treasure chest we finally 
found in our training days...

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.780
The old man hid his appetizer 
in here, no two ways about it.

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:36.610
So how about it, Coco? Can you see inside it?

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:39.850
Electromagnetic waves are being blocked.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:42.650
All I can see are weak electromagnetic waves.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.320
Well, the only thing we can say for sure is

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:50.560
this box is made out of a special 
material that's impervious to all blows.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:56.170
That toughness and durability 
can't be from the Human World.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:59.170
Not even your aqua regia can get through it?

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:00.970
After all, that can melt metal, right?

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:05.780
True, my aqua regia may be able to 
melt through it, little by little,

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.950
but I can't produce a lot of it.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:11.880
And with the thickness of this 
chest, it would take years.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:16.350
I see. Yeah, we really got 
our work cut out for us here.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:21.360
And this ain't the only 
thing we gotta conquer...

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.630
Sounds like it's here already.

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:24.760
Yeah...

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:29.800
The Beast that guards this chest as 
if it were one of its own eggs...

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:34.840
Biotope 8's unbelievably strong chicken...

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:37.510
An Avian Beast... Bajur Coq!

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.940
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:49.880
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:54.110
We're going to use a camera this 
week too, so get yours ready!

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:57.520
Okay, please choose one 
of these three platters.

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:02.290
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:06.390
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:08.530
Alright, here we go!

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.530
A heaping helping...

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:13.130
Open!

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:17.570
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:24.840
A - Air Aqua Capture Level 68

00:22:19.010 --> 00:22:20.670
...yours if you chose A!

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:24.780
Your inherent charisma awakens 
and you may just charm everybody!

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:32.850
B - Growlrus Capture Level 13

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:28.850
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:30.250
You'll have good luck with gifts!

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:32.380
You may even get a really nice present!

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:41.630
C - Freezer Bison Capture Level 11

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:36.620
And I'm sorry. If you chose C, you're third.

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:39.220
It looks like this is going to 
be a hectic, busy week for you.

00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:41.560
Make sure you fit some break time in there!

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:45.100
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:45.100
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:46.870
Alright, here we go!

00:22:47.100 --> 00:22:49.370
3... 2... 1...

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:51.200
Scoop Chance!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:53.810
If you train yourself,

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:56.240
you'll probably get

00:22:56.710 --> 00:22:58.780
what you wish for.

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:04.950
Alright! I'll keep training myself 
until I get a Gourmet scoop!

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:09.490
The Bajur Coq, which once defeated the Four Heavenly Kings...

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.360
Toriko sets his sights on a giant treasure chest.

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:14.490
And what are Komatsu and Otake up to?

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:17.390
Crossroads! A Chef's Destination!

00:23:17.650 --> 00:23:19.360
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
